  "id": "posttest-counseling",
  "term": "posttest counseling",
  "definition": "Posttest counseling is counseling provided after a test result is given, in this source referring to HIV-related care. It may involve the partner and is described as something that can be integrated with discussion and provision of dual contraception in ART clinic services.",
